       "html": "<strong>Aldaezintasuna.</strong>  <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>″</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>″</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math>: ekuazio bera ✓."
