     "mota": "testua",
     "html": "&amp;a_n &amp; quad y &amp;= y_1 integral u dif x <br>&amp;a_(n-1) &amp; quad y&#x27; &amp;= y_1&#x27; integral u dif x + y_1 u <br>&amp;a_(n-2) &amp; quad y&#x27;&#x27; &amp;= y_1&#x27;&#x27; integral u dif x + 2 y_1&#x27; u + y_1 u&#x27; <br>&amp; quad dots.v &amp; quad dots.v &amp; quad dots.v <br>&amp;1 &amp; quad y^((n)) &amp;= y_1^((n)) integral u dif x + n y_1^((n-1)) u + dots.c + y_1 u^((n-1)) <code class=\"formula-ez\"></code>"
