       "html": "<strong>Sistema homogeneoaren zatia.</strong>  <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑨</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></math>. Polinomio karakteristikoa <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></math>."
